             <p><lb n="1"/><supplied reason="lost">gotamip</supplied><milestone n="a" unit="fragment"/><unclear>uta</unclear>sa <space/> sir<unclear>i</unclear>v<unclear>ijaya</unclear><supplied reason="lost">sātaka</supplied><milestone n="b" unit="fragment"/><supplied reason="lost">ni</supplied>sa <space/> savachara <num value="4"><g type="numeral">4</g></num> <space/> gimhāna pākha <num value="2"><g type="numeral">2</g></num> <space/> <unclear>di</unclear> <gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="character"/> <gap reason="lost"/><lb n="2"/><gap reason="lost"/><milestone n="a" unit="fragment"/>ya <space/> budhāya ya sisi<gap reason="lost" quantity="5" unit="character"/><milestone n="b" unit="fragment"/><unclear>ya</unclear> <space/> sisiniA <space/> toḍhikheḍikāA <space/> pava<seg type="aksara"><unclear>y</unclear><seg type="component" subtype="vowel"><gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="component"/></seg></seg><gap reason="lost"/></p>
